{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "SafeTracks (dépôt personnel)"}, "description": {"en-US": "Dépôt F-Droid personnel pour SafeTracks — app Android FOSS d'import/édition de traces GPX avec analyse des restrictions vélo (MapUtagawa/OSM). Voir https://github.com/xavierlpro-coder/SafeTracks.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "d3d12cc53fe559dd8837e993f807011adbf1cf6fa30e04769e93b98e96e0dc7e", "size": 5471}}, "address": "https://xavierlpro-coder.github.io/safetracks-fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1794232300000, "categories": {"Navigation": {"name": {"en-US": "Navigation"}}}}, "packages": {"com.safetracks": {"metadata": {"added": 1794207808000, "categories": ["Navigation"], "lastUpdated": 1794232296000, "license": "Apache-2.0", "authorName": "Xavier Lerouvreur", "name": {"en-US": "SafeTracks"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Import et visualisation de traces GPX, avec analyse des restrictions vélo"}, "description": {"en-US": "SafeTracks permet d'importer, visualiser et éditer des traces GPS au format GPX\nsur une carte interactive. L'application analyse à la demande les portions de\ntrace empruntant des voies à accès restreint pour le vélo (données MapUtagawa/OSM)\net les met en évidence sur la carte (vert/orange/rouge).\n\nAucune dépendance Google Play Services : localisation via l'API AOSP standard,\nfonds de carte sur serveurs publics (OSM, MapUtagawa, IGN)."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/com.safetracks.320600.png", "sha256": "d2667093395e90366d57c32e766b43937f6f689d92c13c32e7d935b01f450c8f", "size": 1335}}, "preferredSigner": "a34211aa028103738576243ec38a15bd11ce37ccd5eae087ea5e4dce6dd3d8fc"}, "versions": {"81c808e78e57f90007ea01fa016a2d85c33aa6440d95b81e99c6a38a54057adf": {"added": 1794232296000, "file": {"name": "/com.safetracks_320600.apk", "sha256": "81c808e78e57f90007ea01fa016a2d85c33aa6440d95b81e99c6a38a54057adf", "size": 3600298}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "32.6.0", "versionCode": 3206